ind":"announcement","title":"FARM BANG DEMO 2.0: QUESTS, WAYPOINTS & HUD OVERHAUL","summary":"Thanks to everyone playing during Next Fest! A lot of you told us the same thing: after the tutorial, you didn’t know what to do next. This update is our answer. The Demo now gives you a clear goal, shows you where to go, and keeps the debt in front of you.You now have something to do: QuestsA 12-step starter chapter, “First Debt”, walks you through the loop of the game: buy an Egg at the Void Bazaar, hatch it in the Genesis Vault, fire a full charge, hunt monsters, pick up loot, sell it at the ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T18:17:25Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114029923","verified_at":"2026-10-21T18:39:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4730460-1846018067934136","game_id":"steam-4730460","kind":"announcement","title":"Dev Log: Boss test GM0001","summary":"Just wrapped up the first test run on GM0001, the Starter Map boss in Farm Bang.What I’m checking right now:Skill timing and animation syncHitbox accuracy vs. the telegraphReadability, so players can dodge it by reading it, not guessingStill very much WIP, so expect placeholder effects and some jank. 😅More tests coming soon. Feedback welcome!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-09T17:17:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067934136","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:41:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4730460-1836506165568623","game_id":"steam-4730460","kind":"announcement","title":"Farm Bang Demo is OUT!","summary":"After months of turning coffee into code, the Farm Bang Demo is finally live!Imagine waking up on an unknown planet...Someone shoves a Gatling Gun into one hand...A DEBT BILL into the other hand......and says:\"Good luck.\"Now your only way to survive is to:🥚 Hatch living ammo 🐔 Raise weird creatures 💥 Load them into your Gatling Gun 👾 Hunt monsters 💰 Sell ridiculously heavy loot 🏦 Pay off an interstellar bank before the Debt Collector comes knocking.Farm Bang is a chaotic mix of:Top-down shooterC","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-02T17:12:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165568623","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:41:07Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4730460":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:04:40Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:04:39Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4730460":"2026-10-26T14:04:40Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4730460":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:04:39Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T14:04:39Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:04:39Z"},"4730470":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:04:40Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T14:04:40Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:04:40Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4730460","app_id":4730460,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:53Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"50e97f871b0a6ebd2ddc39d1352dae50a4da80b6bee48103cba877205e2f9271","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"Raise living ammo, blast monsters, haul massive loot, and survive the debt collectors in this chaotic top-down farming shooter.","publishers":[{"name":"Aloya Productions","creator_clan_account_id":45732259}],"developers":[{"name":"Aloya Productio